; orpot flower holder for the square pot (top plate, fin A1 (slots from top), fin A2 (slots from top), fin B1 (slots from bottom), fin B2 (slots from bottom))
; pot: or_brace2.scad (bottom_w 47, top_w 65, top_h 85, top_or 10); bottom corner r 7 assumed
; material ply3: t 2.63 mm, slots 2.63 mm finished, kerf 0.15 mm compensated (path kerf/2 outside each part)
; geometry (mm): lift 20.0, c 15.0, plate_top 83.0, fin_top 80.37, h 30.64, tab 8.0, gap 4.0, halflap 10.0, hole 61.84, plate_d 139.3
; X0 Y0 = bottom-left corner of the stock
; quickcut: GRBL diode-laser cut, static M3, warmup on every path
; cut: ply3 100% (S1000 of 1000) F350 x1; warmup 1000ms = 5.8mm
; every cut: warmup wiggle (half the warmup out and back), then the passes;
; closed loops overlap the warmup distance past their start; middle-out order
;
;HEAD: laser
;MATERIAL: ply3
;LASER_MODE: static  (M3, constant power; assumes Z already at focus)

$32=1   ; GRBL laser mode (assumes firmware $30=1000)
G21     ; mm
G90     ; absolute
M5      ; laser off

